    "markdown": "![Hugging Face's logo](https://huggingface.co/front/assets/huggingface_logo-noborder.svg) Hugging Face⟨1⟩\n  *  Models ⟨2⟩\n  *  Datasets ⟨3⟩\n  *  Spaces ⟨4⟩\n  *  Buckets new⟨5⟩\n  *  Docs ⟨6⟩\n  *  Enterprise ⟨7⟩\n  * Pricing⟨8⟩\n  *     * Website\n      *  Tasks⟨9⟩\n      *  HuggingChat⟨10⟩\n      *  Collections⟨11⟩\n      *  Languages⟨12⟩\n      *  Organizations⟨13⟩\n    * Community\n      *  Blog⟨14⟩\n      *  Posts⟨15⟩\n      *  Daily Papers⟨16⟩\n      *  Hardware⟨17⟩\n      *  Learn⟨18⟩\n      *  Discord⟨19⟩\n      *  Forum⟨20⟩\n      *  GitHub⟨21⟩\n    * Solutions\n      *  Team & Enterprise⟨7⟩\n      *  Hugging Face PRO⟨22⟩\n      *  Enterprise Support⟨23⟩\n      *  Inference Providers⟨24⟩\n      *  Inference Endpoints⟨25⟩\n      *  Storage Buckets⟨5⟩\n  * * * *\n  * Log In⟨26⟩\n  * Sign Up⟨27⟩\n\n\n#   Datasets:⟨3⟩\n* * *\nDuplicated from Zidu-Wang/3DDFA-V3⟨28⟩\n![⟨29⟩]\n ![](https://huggingface.co/avatars/373f1e6bebcc841825dc1cbc3c59f5e0.svg) ⟨30⟩\nJeayo⟨30⟩\n/\n3DDFA-V3⟨31⟩\nlike 0\nModalities:  Image ⟨32⟩\nFormats:  imagefolder ⟨33⟩\nSize:  100K - 1M ⟨34⟩\nArXiv:\narxiv: 2312.00311\nLibraries:  Datasets ⟨35⟩\nCroissant\n Dataset card ⟨31⟩ Data Studio ⟨36⟩ Files Files and versions xet ⟨37⟩ Community 1 ⟨38⟩\nDataset Viewer\n Auto-converted to Parquet⟨39⟩ API Embed  Duplicate⟨40⟩ Data Studio\nSubset (1)\ndefault · 577k rows\ndefault (577k rows)\nSplit (1)\ntrain · 577k rows\ntrain (577k rows)\nSearch is not available for this dataset\nSQL\nConsole\nThe dataset viewer is not available for this split.\nServer error while post-processing the rows. Please report the issue.\n\n```\nError code:   RowsPostProcessingError\n\n```\n\nNeed help to make the dataset viewer work? Make sure to review how to configure the dataset viewer⟨41⟩, and open a discussion⟨42⟩ for direct support.\n**YAML Metadata Warning:** empty or missing yaml metadata in repo card\nCheck out the documentation⟨43⟩ for more information.\n  * Assets Summary⟨44⟩\n  * Dataset Summary⟨45⟩\n  * Citation⟨46⟩\n\n\n#   ⟨47⟩ Data Card for 3DDFA-V3 \nThis repository provides the data used in CVPR2024 (Highlight)⟨48⟩ paper 3DDFA_V3⟨49⟩. Please see our github repository⟨50⟩ for details.\n##   ⟨44⟩ Assets Summary \n\n```\nassets\n├── face_model.npy              # (face model)\n├── large_base_net.pth\n├── net_recon.pth               # (backbone)\n├── net_recon_mbnet.pth         # (MobileNet-V3 backbone, optional)\n├── retinaface_resnet50_2020-07-20_old_torch.pth\n├── similarity_Lm3D_all.mat\n├── indices_38365_35709.npy     # (optional)\n├── indices_53215_35709.npy     # (optional)\n├── indices_53215_38365.npy     # (optional)\n├── indices_53490_35709.npy     # (optional)\n├── meanshape-68ldms.obj        # (optional)\n├── meanshape-106ldms.obj       # (optional)\n├── meanshape-134ldms.obj       # (optional)\n├── meanshape-parallel.obj      # (optional)\n└── meanshape-seg.obj           # (optional)\n\n```\n\n##   ⟨45⟩ Dataset Summary \n\n```\ndata\n├── mouth_open.zip              #  96,152\n├── ugly_mouth.zip              #  72,114\n├── frown.zip                   # 216,342\n├── eye_close.zip               #  72,114\n├── mouth+eye_close.zip         #  96,152\n└── nose.zip                    #  24,038\n\n```\n\n##   ⟨46⟩ Citation \nIf you use our work in your research, please cite our publication:\n\n```\n@article{wang20233d,\n  title={3D Face Reconstruction with the Geometric Guidance of Facial Part Segmentation},\n  author={Wang, Zidu and Zhu, Xiangyu and Zhang, Tianshuo and Wang, Baiqin and Lei, Zhen},\n  journal={arXiv preprint arXiv:2312.00311},\n  year={2023}\n}\n\n```\n\nCopy to bucket new\nUse this dataset \n\nDownloads last month\n    77\nNumber of rows: 576,912 Total file size: 42.5 GB\n##  Paper for Jeayo/3DDFA-V3\n#### 3D Face Reconstruction with the Geometric Guidance of Facial Part Segmentation Paper • 2312.00311 • Published Dec 1, 2023 ⟨51⟩\nSystem theme\nCompany\nTOS⟨52⟩ Privacy⟨53⟩ About⟨54⟩ Careers⟨55⟩ ⟨1⟩\nWebsite\nModels⟨2⟩ Datasets⟨3⟩ Spaces⟨4⟩ Pricing⟨8⟩ Docs⟨6⟩\n",
